WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.869
-Good evening, I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:04.337
We hope you're doing well.
And now, if you don't mind,

00:00:04.337 --> 00:00:08.007
we're going to get to the news.
President Biden turned 81 today,

00:00:08.007 --> 00:00:09.742
despite his campaign staff

00:00:09.742 --> 00:00:14.614
specifically advising him
not to.

00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:16.082
That's right.
President Biden today

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:18.051
celebrated his 81st birthday,

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:22.555
but not as much
as Republicans did.

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:24.724
President Biden today
presided over the annual

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:26.226
White House turkey pardon.

00:00:26.226 --> 00:00:27.527
It may not hold up, though,

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:30.630
because a lot of what they did
were state crimes.

00:00:33.065 --> 00:00:34.834
That's right.
President Biden presided

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:36.202
over the White House turkey
pardon,

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:38.271
where he pardoned
Liberty and Bell,

00:00:38.271 --> 00:00:40.206
which sounds cute,
but they both broke

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:43.476
into Nancy Pelosi's office
on January 6th.

00:00:46.912 --> 00:00:49.382
While introducing a screening
of the new movie "Wonka"

00:00:49.382 --> 00:00:51.951
yesterday for military families,
President Biden said

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:54.086
that he wished
he could stay and watch the film

00:00:54.086 --> 00:00:56.355
and added, quote,
"I like kids more than adults."

00:00:56.355 --> 00:00:58.190
Do you?

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:00.626
"I like kids.
Now please enjoy this film

00:01:00.626 --> 00:01:04.064
about famous child murderer
Willy Wonka.

00:01:06.398 --> 00:01:07.567
Former President Trump

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:09.301
traveled yesterday
to the southern border,

00:01:09.301 --> 00:01:12.205
but they caught him
before he could make it across.

00:01:14.473 --> 00:01:17.043
Florida Governor
Ron DeSantis' campaign last week

00:01:17.043 --> 00:01:19.778
reportedly raised $2 million
in just two days.

00:01:19.778 --> 00:01:23.850
And when he found out, DeSantis
could not start smiling.

00:01:27.153 --> 00:01:29.121
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis
said yesterday that former

00:01:29.121 --> 00:01:31.691
President Trump is, quote,
"wedded to the teleprompter."

00:01:31.691 --> 00:01:34.026
Yeah, his age --
his aides wish.

00:01:34.026 --> 00:01:36.162
Here he was this weekend
in Iowa.

00:01:36.162 --> 00:01:39.465
-He's not into golden showers,
as they say, they call them.

00:01:39.465 --> 00:01:42.935
He's not.
I don't like that idea.

00:01:42.935 --> 00:01:46.873
-You think<i> that</i> was
on a teleprompter?

00:01:49.309 --> 00:01:52.612
"Make sure we get
golden showers in there."

00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:54.380
If Trump's wedded
to a teleprompter,

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:57.716
he's clearly cheating on it.

00:01:57.716 --> 00:01:59.585
A library in England
recently received

00:01:59.585 --> 00:02:01.087
a copy of<i> Tolkien's World</i>

00:02:01.087 --> 00:02:02.922
that was more than
40 years overdue.

00:02:02.922 --> 00:02:04.624
It's the first time
in recorded history

00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:09.061
that a librarian
has said, "Eh, keep it."

00:02:09.061 --> 00:02:11.697
The 19th annual Guinness
World Records Day

00:02:11.697 --> 00:02:13.132
was held last week,

00:02:13.132 --> 00:02:15.702
beating the previous record
of 18.

00:02:21.007 --> 00:02:23.209
I'll stand by it.

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:24.944
I'll stand by it.
I'm not saying you're wrong,

00:02:24.944 --> 00:02:27.547
but I'm not saying
I'm wrong either.

00:02:27.547 --> 00:02:29.082
Just a classic agree to disagree

00:02:29.082 --> 00:02:31.184
and then move on
with the monologue.

00:02:31.184 --> 00:02:32.985
The more I talk about it,
the weirder it gets.

00:02:32.985 --> 00:02:36.322
But I stand by it.
And finally,

00:02:36.322 --> 00:02:37.924
Amazon recently announced
that next year,

00:02:37.924 --> 00:02:40.359
customers will be able to browse
and purchase cars

00:02:40.359 --> 00:02:41.760
from dealers on their website.

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:44.330
It's the most expensive package
you'll ever have stolen

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:45.498
from your driveway.

00:02:45.498 --> 00:02:47.432
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

00:02:47.432 --> 00:02:49.269
We are up and running.

